5. Sample Demonstration Scenario

Scenario: A user wants information about an online shopping dispute.

Input:

“I paid for a product online, but I did not receive it.”

System Output:

Category:
Consumer Issue

General Information:
Your issue may relate to consumer protection and
online-shopping grievance procedures.

Possible Next Steps:
1. Keep the order confirmation and payment records.
2. Contact the seller/platform.
3. Check the applicable consumer grievance process.
4. Use the relevant official complaint mechanism if necessary.

Official Resources:
[Relevant Government Resource]

Note:
This information is for general educational purposes.
For case-specific legal advice, consult a qualified lawyer.
6. Expected Demonstration Result

At the end of the demonstration, the evaluator should be able to understand that Legalease can:

Accept legal questions in natural language.
Categorize basic legal issues.
Present legal information in simple language.
Provide relevant official resources.
Assist with basic document preparation.
Provide a clear and easy-to-use interface.
7. Conclusion

The Legalease Project Demonstration Phase validates the main concept of the project by showing the complete user journey from entering a legal problem to receiving general information, resources, and document assistance. It demonstrates how AI and web technologies can be combined to make legal information more accessible and understandable.
